    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/e7375f8092650cb1e9d2a162732d8283.poster.avif?t=1745300984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/e7375f8092650cb1e9d2a162732d8283.webm?t=1745300984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/e7375f8092650cb1e9d2a162732d8283.mp4?t=1745300984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>In the post-human wastes of the distant future, you are dispatched to stop the <i>Finis Omnia</i>, a cult hellbent on tearing open reality to unleash an eldritch horror. Armed with mutative upgrades, you\u2019ll blast, interrogate, and investigate your way through a surreal, intergalactic nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a half-organic, half-synthetic law enforcer, mutating to achieve order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the <i>Afterflesh\u00a0</i>\u2014 an intergalactic nightmare of space stations, alien planets, and pocket dimensions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in frenetic top-down combat against cultists, mutants, and otherworldly abominations, using an arsenal of bio-engineered weaponry.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interrogate a cast of bizarre NPCs to unravel the cult\u2019s conspiracy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/e7375f8092650cb1e9d2a162732d8283.poster.avif?t=1745300984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/e7375f8092650cb1e9d2a162732d8283.webm?t=1745300984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2093780/extras/e7375f8092650cb1e9d2a162732d8283.mp4?t=1745300984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>In the post-human wastes of the distant future, you are dispatched to stop the <i>Finis Omnia</i>, a cult hellbent on tearing open reality to unleash an eldritch horror. Armed with mutative upgrades, you\u2019ll blast, interrogate, and investigate your way through a surreal, intergalactic nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a half-organic, half-synthetic law enforcer, mutating to achieve order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the <i>Afterflesh\u00a0</i>\u2014 an intergalactic nightmare of space stations, alien planets, and pocket dimensions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in frenetic top-down combat against cultists, mutants, and otherworldly abominations, using an arsenal of bio-engineered weaponry.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interrogate a cast of bizarre NPCs to unravel the cult\u2019s conspiracy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
